program	while_let_no_else_clause.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	Parse error at 15:40: `while let` has no `else` clause — the loop exits when the binding fails, so there is nothing for an `else` to mean. Use `if let ... else` for a one-shot branch, or put the exhausted case after the loop
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: Parse error at 15:40: `while let` has no `else` clause — the loop exits when the binding fails, so there is nothing for an `else` to mean. Use `if let ... else` for a one-shot branch, or put the exhausted case after the loop"
